ew M2 Mac Signer pool  a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D256681\n", "files": ["taskcluster/config.yml"], "git_node": "45d63741937a4525d64ee37d6722bed54bdf95eb", "git_parents": ["c83064a0a97ed13750b2f66093fe98728559a9c0"], "node": "0296a7a11583c93367bdcaee3cf0794ad03d172b", "parents": ["6079f39015b326f14c6a6d6424091efc80f5fbc1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1752156431, "git_changesets": ["45d63741937a4525d64ee37d6722bed54bdf95eb"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "592": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan Hunt \u003crhunt@eqrion.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1968423 - wasm: Simplify stack result handling in Ion.  a=pascalc\n\nIon stores stack results that are refs using MWasmStoreRef, and this\nis only safe because we manually disable the barriers for the\ninstruction. Add a dedicated node that is safe for ref stack results\nand just does the plain store we need.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D255036\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D256703\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/CodeGenerator.cpp", "js/src/jit/LIROps.yaml", "js/src/jit/Lowering.cpp", "js/src/wasm/WasmIonCompile.cpp"], "git_node": "ebe351bd597db94a23f9e071919d06b09fa57e8b", "git_parents": ["45d63741937a4525d64ee37d6722bed54bdf95eb"], "node": "4bdc152586ef5ef8645e13faffe0513f09f17fdd", "parents": ["0296a7a11583c93367bdcaee3cf0794ad03d172b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1752164940, "git_changesets": ["ebe351bd597db94a23f9e071919d06b09fa57e8b"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "593": {"changesets": [{"author": "Pascal Chevrel \u003cpascal@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1976512 - fix macos build bustage caused by gpuFence member which doesn't exist in esr128 r=gfx-reviewers,jrmuizel a=RyanVM\" for bustage a=backout\n\nThis reverts commit c83064a0a97ed13750b2f66093fe98728559a9c0.\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/CanvasRenderingContext2D.cpp"], "git_node": "995693849bcbca53fc7c68a3e0